# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Confidential source material — MUST NOT be committed.
#
# The original JD documents were shared with the institute by recruiting
# companies for a specific batch; the question tracker records interview
# experiences contributed by named classmates; CampusRecruitmentBook.pdf is a
# copyrighted commercial publication. None may be redistributed.
#
# Keep these outside the repo and point the extractor at them locally.
# See README for how to supply them.
#
# NOTE: data/seed_source/jd_extract/ IS committed — the app needs it to serve
# the JD and question-bank modules, and it is ~1.4 MB of derived JSON rather
# than 53 MB of source documents. It is only safe to commit while this repo
# stays PRIVATE and registration is limited via ALLOWED_EMAIL_DOMAINS.
# If this repo is ever made public again, remove it first.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
